# Halana and Alena, Partners ({2}{R}{G}, 2/3 reach first strike): "At the beginning of combat on your turn, put X +1/+1 counters
# on another target creature you control, where X is Halana and Alena's power. That creature gains haste until end of turn."
# Bot1 casts Halana on turn 1 from four Moxen: with no other creature she has no target and nothing happens. On turn 3 it
# casts Grizzly Bears and Memnite; at the beginning of combat the Bears are the target (Halana herself and Bot2's Ornithopter
# are refused) and get two counters, 4/4, and haste: the just-cast Bears attack for 4 (20 to 16). Memnite got nothing. On
# Bot2's turn 4 there is no trigger, and on turn 5 the haste is gone but the counters stay.

